Search file contents by regex or literal text; returns matching lines grouped by file, most recently modified files first (max {{ .MaxResults }}); respects .gitignore. Use glob to filter by filename, not contents. The pattern is a regular expression unless literal_text is true, so escape ( ) [ ] { } . * + ? | ^ $ to match them as written: `func \(s \*Server\)` finds `func (s *Server)`.
